title: [+ z_party_name +]'s Turn
new-page: true
face-image: img/center_poster.jpg
on-arrival: z_turn_taken = 1;
view-if: z_turn_taken == 0
tags: event

= [+ z_party_name +]'s Turn

- @labor_affairs

@labor_affairs
title: Labor Affairs
view-if: labor_minister_party == z_party_name and labor_affairs_timer == 0 and strike_term_seen == 0

The industrial Ruhr region is aflame with labor unrest

- @support_labor
- @balance
- @support_employers
- @support_labor_cvp
- @balance_cvp
- @support_employers_cvp

@support_labor
title: Zentrum will will support labor in their demands
view-if: z_party_name != "CVP" and ((z_leader == "Wirth" and not (dvp_in_government or dnvp_in_government or nsdap_in_government)) or (z_leader == "Joos" and spd_in_government and peoples_party) or z_leader == "Kaiser")

Popular among the workers, this will alienate the bourgeoisie.

go-to: labor_affairs.support_labor
     
@support_employers
title: Zentrum will support the employers in their demands.
view-if: z_party_name != "CVP" and (z_leader == "Bracht" or z_leader == "Kaas" or z_leader == "Brüning")

Popular among the bourgeoisie, much less so among the workers.

go-to: labor_affairs.balance

@balance
title: Zentrum will try to strike a compromise between the sides.
view-if: z_party_name != "CVP" and (z_leader == "Adenauer" or z_leader == "Marx" or z_leader == "Stegerwald")

Both sides need to share the pain in the current crisis.

go-to: labor_affairs.support_employers

@support_labor_cvp
title: The CVP will will support labor in their demands
view-if: z_party_name == "CVP" and ((z_leader == "Wirth" and not (dvp_in_government or dnvp_in_government or nsdap_in_government)) or (z_leader == "Joos" and spd_in_government and peoples_party) or z_leader == "Kaiser")

Popular among the workers, this will alienate the bourgeoisie.

go-to: labor_affairs.support_labor
     
@support_employers_cvp
title: The CVP will support the employers in their demands.
view-if: z_party_name == "CVP" and (z_leader == "Bracht" or z_leader == "Kaas" or z_leader == "Brüning")

Popular among the bourgeoisie, much less so among the workers.

go-to: labor_affairs.balance

@balance_cvp
title: The CVP will try to strike a compromise between the sides.
view-if: z_party_name == "CVP" and (z_leader == "Adenauer" or z_leader == "Marx" or z_leader == "Stegerwald")

Both sides need to share the pain in the current crisis.

go-to: labor_affairs.support_employers